    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Structured Output via tool_use (Task Statement 4.3)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Why tool_use is the answer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Defining an \"extraction tool\" whose "
        },
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "input schema is your target JSON schema"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " and reading the structured data out of the "
        },
        {
          "t": "code",
          "v": "tool_use"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " block is "
        },
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "the most reliable way to get guaranteed schema-compliant output"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ". It "
        },
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "eliminates JSON syntax errors"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " (no unbalanced braces, no markdown fences, no trailing commas)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "tools = [{\n  \"name\": \"record_invoice\",\n  \"description\": \"Record extracted invoice data\",\n  \"input_schema\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"invoice_number\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n      \"total\": {\"type\": \"number\"},\n      \"due_date\": {\"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]},          # nullable!\n      \"category\": {\"enum\": [\"utilities\", \"services\", \"goods\", \"unclear\", \"other\"]},\n      \"category_detail\": {\"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]}     # pairs with \"other\"\n    },\n    \"required\": [\"invoice_number\", \"total\"]\n  }\n}]\nresp = client.messages.create(..., tools=tools, tool_choice={\"type\": \"any\"})\ndata = next(b.input for b in resp.content if b.type == \"tool_use\")"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Critical limitation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Strict schemas eliminate "
        },
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "syntax"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " errors but "
        },
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "NOT semantic errors"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ": line items that don't sum to the stated total, values placed in the wrong fields, plausible-but-wrong extractions. Semantic quality still needs validation + prompting."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "tool_choice (memorize the three)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Setting"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Behavior"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Use when"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          [
            {
              "t": "code",
              "v": "\"auto\""
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "May reply with plain text OR call a tool"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Conversational agents"
            }
          ]
        ],
        [
          [
            {
              "t": "code",
              "v": "\"any\""
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "MUST call a tool, model picks which"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Multiple extraction schemas, unknown document type — guarantees structured output"
            }
          ]
        ],
        [
          [
            {
              "t": "code",
              "v": "{\"type\": \"tool\", \"name\": \"extract_metadata\"}"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "MUST call that exact tool"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Force a specific extraction first (e.g., metadata before enrichment), then handle subsequent steps in follow-up turns"
            }
          ]
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Schema design to prevent hallucination"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "Optional/nullable fields"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " for information that "
            },
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "may not exist in the source"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": ". If a field is "
            },
            {
              "t": "code",
              "v": "required"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " but absent from the document, the model tends to "
            },
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "fabricate a value to satisfy the schema"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": ". Nullable → it returns null instead."
            }
          ],
          "marker": "none",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "Enums"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " with escape hatches: add "
            },
            {
              "t": "code",
              "v": "\"unclear\""
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " for ambiguous cases and "
            },
            {
              "t": "code",
              "v": "\"other\""
            },
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": " + a detail string field"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " for extensible categories."
            }
          ],
          "marker": "none",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Include "
            },
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "format normalization rules in the prompt"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " alongside the strict schema (e.g., \"convert all dates to ISO 8601; strip currency symbols\") to tame inconsistent source formatting."
            }
          ],
          "marker": "none",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
